Integrate WrapperCache into runtime.Context and initialize/cleanup via context_manager.

## Objective
Add wrapper_cache field to runtime.Context and wire up initialization/cleanup in the context manager so each V8 context has its own wrapper cache.

## Technical Details

### Changes to runtime.Context
File: src/runtime/context.zig

```zig
pub const Context = struct {
    allocator: std.mem.Allocator,
    // ... existing fields ...

    /// V8 wrapper cache (only present when running with V8)
    wrapper_cache: ?WrapperCache = null,

    pub fn initV8WrapperCache(self: *Context, v8_context: *v8.Context) !void {
        const WrapperCache = @import("engines/v8/wrapper_cache.zig").WrapperCache;
        self.wrapper_cache = WrapperCache.init(self.allocator, v8_context);
    }

    pub fn deinitV8WrapperCache(self: *Context) void {
        if (self.wrapper_cache) |*cache| {
            cache.deinit();
            self.wrapper_cache = null;
        }
    }
};
```

